; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) records for leonardwong.tech.
;
; Import these records into the authoritative DNS zone for leonardwong.tech.
; DNSSEC must be enabled at the authoritative provider; RRSIG/NSEC records
; are provider-generated and must not be hand-authored in this file.

$ORIGIN leonardwong.tech.
$TTL 3600

; Discovery index and the A2A service both terminate on the HTTPS portfolio
; origin. The Agent Card is served from /.well-known/agent-card.json.
_index._agents 3600 IN SVCB 1 leonardwong.tech. alpn="h2,http/1.1" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_a2a._agents   3600 IN HTTPS 1 leonardwong.tech. alpn="h2,http/1.1" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
